      <title>Transportation Guide</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/2026/transportation/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/2026/transportation/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;getting-to-the-venue&#34;&gt;Getting to the Venue&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.wangjianghotel.com/index.html&#34;&gt;Wangjiang Hotel&lt;/a&gt;(No.42 Xiashahepu Street, Jinjiang District, 610066, Chengdu, Sichuan, China)is reachable by taxi or metro from the city’s main transport hubs. Use the routes below for the smoothest arrival experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;from-chengdu-shuangliu-international-airport&#34;&gt;From Chengdu Shuangliu International Airport&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taxi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distance: ~22 km&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Duration: ~0.5 hour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boarding point: Ride-hailing pickup area at Terminal 2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metro&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enter at Shuangliu Airport Station (Exit B).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take the Suburban Line to Zhujiang road Station.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transfer to Line 8 toward Dongda road Station.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Walk 700 m to the hotel entrance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Total duration: ~1 hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;from-chengdu-tianfu-international-airport&#34;&gt;From Chengdu Tianfu International Airport&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taxi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
